      ],
      "scope": "Unit",
      "engineArgumentCount": 0,
      "valence": "Positive",
      "description": "Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 30\u0022 and in line of sight of this model and roll one die, on a 4\u002B place a token on it. Friendly units may remove tokens from their target before rolling to hit to get \u002BX to hit rolls when attacking, where X is the number of removed tokens."
    },
